The group is `8` permutations of `Fin 9`, the excess permutations that pin it from above are `14`,
and the invariant family it acts on has `3,486,784,401` members. How many of those have this group
as their automorphism group *exactly* is not computed and does not need to be: the family is indexed
by the subtype `Magma.tup9R910` of transport tuples passing `Magma.tupOK`, and both sides of the
rectangle are decided by search rather than by enumeration. See `Definability/ExactPrune.lean` for
